+7D2 RAW capture-point comparison
+========================================
+:License: GPL
+:Summary: Guarded RAW capture-point comparison for 7D2 1.1.2
+
+Experimental 7D2 1.1.2 only. Three full RAW frame dumps before and after
+Canon's DEFCORRE selector. Restores the original selector on task exit.
+Movie Live View 1080, 1x; RAW video enabled but NOT recording; pre-record OFF.
+No recorder changes, DMA redirection, compression or automatic video recording.
+Once per boot. Start with lens cap on and a charged battery. Return TP* logs.
